{"suttaId":"sn35.158","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[979,979],"vripara":"158"},"segments":{"sn35.158:0.3":"Ajjhattaaniccanandikkhayasuttaṃ","sn35.158:1.1":"“Cakkhuṃ, bhikkhave, yoniso manasi karotha; cakkhāniccatañca yathābhūtaṃ samanupassatha.","sn35.158:1.2":"Cakkhuṃ, bhikkhave, bhikkhu yoniso manasikaronto, cakkhāniccatañca yathābhūtaṃ samanupassanto cakkhusmimpi nibbindati.","sn35.158:1.3":"Nandikkhayā rāgakkhayo;","sn35.158:1.4":"rāgakkhayā nandikkhayo.","sn35.158:1.5":"Nandirāgakkhayā cittaṃ suvimuttanti vuccati.","sn35.158:1.6":"Sotaṃ, bhikkhave, yoniso manasi karotha … ghānaṃ … jivhaṃ, bhikkhave, yoniso manasi karotha;","sn35.158:1.8":"jivhāniccatañca yathābhūtaṃ samanupassatha.","sn35.158:1.9":"Jivhaṃ, bhikkhave, bhikkhu yoniso manasikaronto, jivhāniccatañca yathābhūtaṃ samanupassanto jivhāyapi nibbindati.","sn35.158:1.10":"Nandikkhayā rāgakkhayo;","sn35.158:1.11":"rāgakkhayā nandikkhayo.","sn35.158:1.12":"Nandirāgakkhayā cittaṃ suvimuttanti vuccati.","sn35.158:1.13":"Kāyaṃ … manaṃ, bhikkhave, yoniso manasi karotha;","sn35.158:1.14":"manāniccatañca yathābhūtaṃ samanupassatha.","sn35.158:1.15":"Manaṃ, bhikkhave, bhikkhu yoniso manasikaronto, manāniccatañca yathābhūtaṃ samanupassanto manasmimpi nibbindati.","sn35.158:1.16":"Nandikkhayā rāgakkhayo;","sn35.158:1.17":"rāgakkhayā nandikkhayo.","sn35.158:1.18":"Nandirāgakkhayā cittaṃ suvimuttanti vuccatī”ti.","sn35.158:1.19":"Tatiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0304a.att","from":280,"to":281,"paras":[{"para":280,"vripara":"156-159","refs":["sn35.158:1"],"lines":["156-159. Nandikkhayavaggassa paṭhame <b>nandikkhayā rāgakkhayo, rāgakkhayā nandikkhayo</b>ti nandiyā ca rāgassa ca atthato ekattā vuttaṃ.","<b>Suvimuttan</b>ti arahattaphalavimuttivasena suṭṭhu vimuttaṃ.","Sesamettha dutiyādīsu ca uttānameva."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.158:1"],["sn35.158:1"],["sn35.158:1"]]},{"para":281,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.158:1"],"lines":["5-6. Jīvakambavanasamādhisuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.158:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0304t.tik","from":296,"to":298,"paras":[{"para":296,"vripara":"156-159","refs":["sn35.158:1"],"lines":["156-159. <b>Atthato</b>ti sabhāvato.","Ñāṇena ariyato ñātabbato <b>attho,</b> sabhāvoti.","Evañhi abhijjanasabhāvo nandanaṭṭhena <b>nandī,</b> rañjanaṭṭhena <b>rāgo.</b>","<b>Vimuttivasenā</b>ti vimuttiyā adhigamavasena.","<b>Etthā</b>ti imasmiṃ paṭhamasutte.","<b>Dutiyādīsū</b>ti dutiyatatiyacatutthesu.","<b>Uttānameva</b> heṭṭhā vuttanayattā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.158:1"],["sn35.158:1"],["sn35.158:1"],["sn35.158:1"],["sn35.158:1"],["sn35.158:1"],["sn35.158:1"]]},{"para":297,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ajjhattanandikkhayasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":298,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.158:1"],"lines":["5-6. Jīvakambavanasamādhisuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.158:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
